EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Well, good evening to you!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hey! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Did I fake you out?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Because it's still MORNING!
Yeah, it's the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Winter Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} today!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Wow, it's going to be super weird
being dark all day, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Anda, buenas noches!...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}¿Te lo has creído?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡En realidad ya es de día!
Es que es el solsticio de invierno.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hoy va a ser un día superraro,
así tan oscuro, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Buonaseraaa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Beh? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Te la sei bevuta, eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}È ancora mattina! Ah ah ah!
Eh sì, oggi è il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}solstizio d'inverno{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Lo so, roba da pazzi! Sarà buio
tutto il giorno, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

EN:
Good morning!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Yeah, no joke! It's morning!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
But it's still, like, night, right?
It's going to be dark all...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}day...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}long.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Because it's the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Winter Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
¡Buenos días!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Que sí, que es de día!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Aunque parezca de noche.
Pasaremos el día entero a oscuras.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Será una noche muy, muy larga,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
Buongiorno!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sì, mica scherzo, è davvero giorno!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Anche se sembra ancora notte, no?
Oggi sarà buio tutto il giorno.
Perché? Perché è il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}solstizio
d'inverno{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

